    "title": "Brown Library Announces Reduced Hours and Closures for Thanksgiving Week - NewsBreak",
    "text": "4 hours ago Brown Library, including the Testing Center in M314, will have reduced hours during Thanksgiving week. On Sunday, November 24, and Monday, November 25, the library will be open from 8 a.m. to 8 p.m.\nThe library will be closed from Tuesday, November 26, through Saturday, November 29, for the holiday break. Regular hours will resume on Monday, December 1, at 8 a.m. Due to construction, check your email for any updates about library services.\nVisit here for more details This post includes content assisted by AI tools. Please refer to the source for verification and additional information. Learn more.",
